{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_078_1000_p", "source_sha256": "90e4a213faf78f595f9933111e95bbddeab9f7b982432156c745cb5228994707", "ja": "（定期公演のセットリストに、新曲を入れる事にした。\n今回は、志保にお願いしようと思ってるんだけど……）", "zh": "（决定把新歌加入定期公演的歌单。\n这次我想拜托志保来唱，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_078_1001_p", "source_sha256": "94ce49f1b769150340c574dc468a2491b6f270d5f470b60a7dd0f824a13e2dec", "ja": "お疲れさま……あ、志保。\nよかった、ここにいたんだな。", "zh": "辛苦了……啊，志保。\n太好了，你在这里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_078_1002_033sih", "source_sha256": "ae333668854034d78ac0ee2c529db92816085c6b807867408b38275462eedaeb", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです。\n私に何か？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了。\n找我有事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_078_1003_p", "source_sha256": "abe2a78a77cea59a20cc2bf4f3047ad5c22ab9918ab69162ab498dbb4cf36cfa", "ja": "ああ。次の定期公演なんだけど、\n新曲を志保に任せようと思ってるんだ。", "zh": "啊。关于下次的定期公演，\n我想把新歌交给志保来负责。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_078_1004_033sih", "source_sha256": "545932cb255237f01e451de8e52e0605888fdb822daca3026665bf7f24ce2238", "ja": "えっ。私に？", "zh": "诶？交给我？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_078_1005_036kan", "source_sha256": "75f9ab6ab25b3c6fc01e87d2bfc167059ac2461e8ca16cd96d322e5b3f668e9c", "ja": "わぁ！　ほらほら、私の言ったとおりでしょ？\nやったね、志保ちゃん♪", "zh": "哇！你看你看，就跟我说的一样吧？\n太好了呢，志保♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_078_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "8d07c0fd8de8d4f10c2ce86788a6242659452e2d001d1e4ac336e1cd529fa798", "ja": "良かったじゃない、志保！　それで\n{$P$}、曲はもうできてるんですか？", "zh": "太好了，志保！那么，{$P$}，曲子已经做好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_078_1007_p", "source_sha256": "3172e1707dec874829955f68d877ac9ff22dc49c4c1eccc3e77a79d1293fd624", "ja": "残念ながら、まだ作成中だ。\n曲調はバラードになる予定だよ。", "zh": "很遗憾，还在创作中。\n曲调预计会是抒情曲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_078_1008_033sih", "source_sha256": "989fb48431d9530c37a2d0ce1ab7534f8af4549b16a63cb2e9290a77c90b6fa8", "ja": "バラード……。", "zh": "抒情曲……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_078_1009_p", "source_sha256": "e79902eb3c19f7a4533345f66cf7c7666a41a6f57a79bcddf34365f244c3ef3e", "ja": "ああ。もし、志保に何か希望があるなら、\n今のうちなら聞けるよ。考えておいてくれ。", "zh": "啊。如果志保有什么希望，趁现在还来得及，可以告诉我。你先考虑一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_078_1010_033sih", "source_sha256": "4ba38b55bcab41c694c479410a5a3843ffa1371b3398d009a23beaea64206e54", "ja": "わかりました。考えておきます。", "zh": "明白了。我会考虑的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_078_1011_se", "source_sha256": "b7d769a933cc8cb3d4f3dc26614c33cd76e85fd1cebd43fb943338373783a379", "ja": "ガチャガチャ、バタン！", "zh": "嘎啦嘎啦，砰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_078_1012_033sih", "source_sha256": "08e754597f21822c21368b1458cbdebbfbb406d5dfe5615b3bc78938d2fc9824", "ja": "ただいま！\nあのね、お母さん……あ。", "zh": "我回来了！\n那个，妈妈……啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_078_1013_033sih", "source_sha256": "183757a448e009907fe4539707d0f40e876dc63f4cd1d6bcdcf3805ac2303099", "ja": "今日は、まだ帰ってないんだ……。\nあ、いたっ……何か踏んじゃった。オモチャ？", "zh": "今天还没回来呢……\n啊，好痛……踩到什么东西了。玩具？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_078_1014_033sih", "source_sha256": "610210e7edf7b6426c41c61a285e9a3da7cfb9fe4ec2375178d40ff7fed545d6", "ja": "もう。りっくんたら、また出しっぱなし。\nちゃんと片付けなきゃダメって言ってるのに……。", "zh": "真是的。小陆也是，又拿出来乱扔。\n明明都跟他说过必须要好好收拾了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_078_1015_033sih", "source_sha256": "74b04754341c3ee20180b25be691f92c2967cda760b486f979b8e34c7b092667", "ja": "あ……洗濯物、まだ干しっぱなし。\n急いで取り込まなくちゃ。", "zh": "啊……衣服还晾在外面。\n得赶紧收进来才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_078_1017_033sih", "source_sha256": "e4903669c85141db47f897daaec16c2e89f731c073f95b6b38c0f81aa1165977", "ja": "よし、洗濯物の片付けおしまい。\nそれにしても、お母さんとりっくん、遅いな……。", "zh": "好，衣服收拾完了。\n话又说回来，妈妈和陆陆好慢啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_078_1018_033sih", "source_sha256": "5836810a7bd8a9f94bc408e181017576b04438da2ddac8bb63689c4384f6e5ca", "ja": "……ねえ、ネコさん。\nあなたしかいないから、聞いてくれる？", "zh": "……呐，猫咪。\n现在就只有你在，能听我说说吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_078_1019_033sih", "source_sha256": "58537f44dbaadab87bd8c4b0aeadd80c899feb28809391f7497497bf36054d02", "ja": "私、今度新曲を歌えることになったの。すごいでしょ？\nバラードなんだって。どんな曲なのかな……。", "zh": "我啊，这次要唱新曲了。厉害吧？\n听说是首抒情曲。不知道是什么样的歌……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_078_1020_se", "source_sha256": "923a5f44d3d0789315e9af9d4754be386290b598221c0f8cc7990e61f01f8893", "ja": "ガチャガチャ、バタン。", "zh": "哐当哐当，砰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_078_1021_shihonohaha", "source_sha256": "54290808a3e3c1b396c2e16f2fb30f6867b432b72e872ca49eb13fcaa3e944b0", "ja": "ただいま～。", "zh": "我回来了～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_078_1022_033sih", "source_sha256": "12bdd7fbb5091557c632f7c2aa8570dbe5614dd02a75258ff030ba486397f7cc", "ja": "あっ、お母さん！　おかえりなさい……\nりっくん、どうしたの？", "zh": "啊，妈妈！欢迎回来……\n陆君，怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_078_1023_shihonohaha", "source_sha256": "5a8c8b400154b1a51d1c49b0388b4992cbbb8a67ae584499647ffff4cb13fe55", "ja": "それが、帰りに急に具合が悪くなっちゃって。\n保育園でカゼが流行ってるらしいんだけど……。", "zh": "可是，回去的路上突然不舒服了。听说保育园里好像正在流行感冒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_078_1024_033sih", "source_sha256": "72f7c0fbe64e5aa31581f6357db414db1827b365e68ee55e6d7b53b7e2ec596e", "ja": "そうなんだ……りっくん、大丈夫？", "zh": "这样啊……小陆，没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_078_1025_riku", "source_sha256": "458a2ccef5ee1de20edad8d0f44f5c907febea0a7cea2670f47b86d64432f048", "ja": "おねえちゃん……。", "zh": "姐姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_078_1026_shihonohaha", "source_sha256": "df9968cf7b4d4fe27003aa07c7abc0b63865979898eb3fb3e4a2a0e77d839032", "ja": "りっくんを病院に連れて行くわ。志保、引き出しから\n保険証を取ってきてくれる？　あと封筒も。", "zh": "我带小陆去一趟医院。志保，你能从抽屉里\n把医保卡拿过来吗？还有信封也是。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_078_1027_033sih", "source_sha256": "e26a9015eda1acfc78fdbbbdd48d437aac4b8f8fe08c60d765d2fbfd206852a9", "ja": "わかった。", "zh": "我明白了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_078_1028_033sih", "source_sha256": "b8a20d3b496384d98f3485569e604d43a9d94064cae42b7ecbf2cd4487bac280", "ja": "えっと、保険証と封筒と……？\nこんなところに、私の名前の通帳が……？", "zh": "那个，医保卡、信封，还有……？\n这种地方怎么会有写着我名字的存折……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_078_1029_033sih", "source_sha256": "c8d46ca9977d2fb5b7e02a60ca34702f51a318aec2565900424c29a965dcd6dc", "ja": "えっ。これって、もしかして……。", "zh": "诶。这个难道是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_078_1030_033sih", "source_sha256": "7536d20648302d84829cec354c2b54a7187035c6fb44eaf3076b64dba238575e", "ja": "お母さん、保険証と封筒持ってきた。\n……あと。あの、これって……。", "zh": "妈妈，我把医保卡和信封拿来了。\n……还有。那个，这个是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_078_1031_shihonohaha", "source_sha256": "4d808fb8100448fffae32bf26bf9b6b20ffc085735c54792f524c5314e5b2893", "ja": "え？　あら、いけない。", "zh": "咦？哎呀，糟糕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_078_1032_033sih", "source_sha256": "2de4b5bfa4954f63c3aa9c277b3f2e23decf138570ecc247c1ae370d6d0f5e1b", "ja": "あの……お母さん。これって、私が今までアイドルの\nお仕事でもらった、お給料だよね。使ってないの？", "zh": "那个……妈妈。这笔钱，是我以前做偶像\n工作拿到的工资吧。你都没用吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_078_1033_shihonohaha", "source_sha256": "e21336bcbd631cd08828e04455d4068a7f60faf85c31a216ec6a8abff238c4c7", "ja": "ええ、そうよ。今のところは、お母さんが働いた\nお給料だけでも、なんとか生活できているし……。", "zh": "是的，没错。至少目前，仅靠妈妈工作赚来的工资，也还能勉强维持生活……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_078_1034_shihonohaha", "source_sha256": "2f23e08cd9c80edc52b54cb44379456aa5f15306eb7ac7bd3255b4e7209ac718", "ja": "だから志保のお給料は、貯金してるの。\n何かあった時のためにね。", "zh": "所以志保的工资，我都存起来了。\n以防万一嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_078_1035_033sih", "source_sha256": "5ec0928725ba0b2e2216cfebdad6f1786b2ae35360bc26988a0ddc174f188e9e", "ja": "そう……なんだ……。", "zh": "这样……呀……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_078_1036_shihonohaha", "source_sha256": "feddc5e72f0ed6bc06044d523317d086ae4e94444bb0a3bd47decf0864a8d085", "ja": "それじゃ、ちょっと行ってくるわね。\n志保、鍵をかけてね。", "zh": "那么，我先出去一下。\n志保，记得锁门。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_078_1037_033sih", "source_sha256": "a06b030a11175ac7f8bd4049b29632e30fc39d33f55aeeffb76409c3ec3fc2b0", "ja": "あ、うん。\nいってらっしゃい。", "zh": "啊，嗯。\n路上小心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_078_1038_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_078_1039_shihonohaha", "source_sha256": "8cc29482b8d6d491be759e586f2e972e5f1ca53e07f3a09ffdbec083473471e9", "ja": "ただいま～。遅くなっちゃったわね。", "zh": "我回来啦～抱歉回来晚了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_078_1040_033sih", "source_sha256": "7b6d436c823ac000054c394278414cc02d4c6ca863a21bb13b88fa9029d459ac", "ja": "おかえりなさい、お母さん。\nりっくんの具合はどう？", "zh": "欢迎回来，妈妈。\n小陆的身体怎么样了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_078_1041_shihonohaha", "source_sha256": "7135fc8cadd9f1563d419d4739285bde987b2b51404ec1529511bee874e6f935", "ja": "やっぱりカゼみたい、お薬もらってきたわ。\n帰りの車で寝ちゃったから、このまま寝かせるわ。", "zh": "看来确实是感冒了，已经拿了药回来。\n在回程的车上睡着了，就让她这样继续睡吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_078_1042_shihonohaha", "source_sha256": "863ece2811beab76bc29b85ab694c9d760727bb4abd88db946f3fc29e1d57eeb", "ja": "遅くなってごめんなさいね、志保。\n夕ご飯にしましょう。", "zh": "抱歉回来晚了，志保。\n我们吃晚饭吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_078_1043_033sih", "source_sha256": "e44f185d222031f1eea490c61f4da1b10d7847fa77fcf94153d259e4d762d899", "ja": "あ、それなら私がやるわ。", "zh": "啊，那就我来做吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_078_1044_shihonohaha", "source_sha256": "3cefd770541c34c1c94262441d31bb4d0a34424985c70fd2d3adc6ef87d2255f", "ja": "そう？　ありがとう。じゃありっくんが起きたら\n食べられるように、ご飯はお粥で炊いてくれる？", "zh": "这样啊？谢谢。那能把饭煮成粥吗？这样等里克醒来后就可以吃了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_078_1045_033sih", "source_sha256": "e26a9015eda1acfc78fdbbbdd48d437aac4b8f8fe08c60d765d2fbfd206852a9", "ja": "わかった。", "zh": "我明白了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_078_1047_033sih", "source_sha256": "78ad589437489c513bbe2500c887f80a467ad023ccd0a53f1a8f1bbad4d411eb", "ja": "ねえ、お母さん。\n私のお給料のことなんだけど……。", "zh": "那个，妈妈。\n关于我的工资……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_078_1048_shihonohaha", "source_sha256": "cd03c57642acf9e25ae326cd4e76257c60e7ee2bfef8bc6d1b4cc0c863152260", "ja": "なあに、何か欲しいものでもあるの？", "zh": "怎么了，是有什么想要的东西吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_078_1049_033sih", "source_sha256": "9d3fa8fb25da78261917bfb799878eae9de1708f5e2ffbff9d80e500a4bff450", "ja": "そうじゃなくて。……あれを使えば、\nお母さんはもっと家にいられるんじゃないの？", "zh": "不是这个意思。……要是用那个，妈妈不是就能多待在家里了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_078_1050_shihonohaha", "source_sha256": "97ae52736f55d4c68f075fc14c4d053eba4c99628c1e59b135179c0e80dd6226", "ja": "う～ん、そうね……。少しは、\nいられるようになるかもしれないけど……。", "zh": "嗯～，是啊……或许能稍微待久一点……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_078_1052_shihonohaha", "source_sha256": "649da3152e96ee5ca1d5577738e9e1e3389e6f0a175b92c35f525676082b0039", "ja": "でもやっぱり、あまり変わらないかもしれないわ。\nごめんなさいね、志保。", "zh": "不过说到底，可能也不会有太大变化。\n对不起，志保。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_078_1053_033sih", "source_sha256": "d2f7339807394dc677b4ed572965dc7059a1ad071145df59f5e06162af4269e0", "ja": "そう……。", "zh": "这样啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_078_1054_shihonohaha", "source_sha256": "41cad28a4646d582c2c7bbc931b3b626b70fe323a7546ae6813210cbc27e0ca3", "ja": "でも、アイドルになってから志保が楽しそうで、\nお母さんはとってもうれしいわ。", "zh": "不过，志保成为偶像之后看起来很开心，妈妈真的特别高兴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_078_1055_033sih", "source_sha256": "d9766e9147e16acb5c634af1638878647227edf68b86074009e06e1355f46627", "ja": "楽しそう……？　私が？", "zh": "看起来很开心……？我？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
